Motiquies Sign System

Derived from JR-Guidance-Sign-Web-Editor by its upstream contributors:
https://github.com/endcreeper861/JR-Guidance-Sign-Web-Editor

The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0 is retained in LICENSE.
The original source history and attribution notices are preserved.

This version adds Chongqing rectangular sign presets, editable primitive
compositions, fictional railway lines and line files, multiple sign boards,
per-sign proportions and export controls, transfer doorway signs, editable
multi-row direction signs, line palette integration, and interaction fixes.
It also adds a static public server-line catalog managed through data/lines.json.

Reference-standard layouts are implemented as editable examples. Fonts and
icons inherited from upstream retain their original attribution and terms;
the project license does not override any applicable third-party terms.
